        "id": 1287197
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-20T15:17:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So it neither uses the Request Capability Mismatch bit nor the Sink Capabilities to request the current it needs to function?  \n\nWe should attach detailed traces to a bug and discuss this with the dock vendor.  There are a number of ways in the specification for a dock to advertise that it requires more power.  The dock should use one of them so it can interoperate with systems well",
      "parentUuid": "2a1afec7_8bca9724",
